## Key Design Decisions

| Element | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| **Line length** | `68ch` max width | Keeps lines in the 60–75 character range for comfortable reading |
| **Title** | Sans-serif, `clamp()` sizing, `text-wrap: balance` | Scales fluidly and avoids awkward single-word last lines |
| **Metadata** | Flexbox with `::before` dot separators | No extra markup needed, and it wraps cleanly on mobile |
| **Body** | Serif, `line-height: 1.7` | Good readability for long-form text |
| **Pull quotes** | Accent border, tinted background, decorative quote mark | Stand out visually without overpowering the content |
| **Theming** | CSS custom properties | Easy to rebrand, with dark mode built in |

**Optional:** add the `pull-quote--float` class to make a quote float into the right margin on wide screens, which gives a magazine-style look.

