## Key Design Decisions

| Element | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| **Line length** | `68ch` max width | Keeps lines in the optimal 60–75 character range for readability |
| **Line height** | `1.7` body, `1.1` title | Generous for long-form reading, tight for large display type |
| **Type pairing** | Serif body, sans metadata/headings | Creates clear hierarchy; metadata reads as "interface," body as "content" |
| **Fluid sizing** | `clamp()` | Scales smoothly from mobile to desktop without breakpoint jumps |
| **Spacing** | `* + *` selector with `em` units | Rhythm scales proportionally with font size |
| **Pull quotes** | Break out of column on wide screens | Adds visual interest and signals they're distinct from body flow |
| **Text wrapping** | `balance` / `pretty` | Prevents awkward ragged titles and orphaned words (progressive enhancement) |

The `--aside` modifier gives you a floated pull quote variant for magazine-style layouts. Just add both classes to the blockquote.

