| **`clamp()` font sizes** | Fluid typography that scales smoothly between mobile and desktop |
| **Serif body / sans meta** | Creates clear visual hierarchy between content and UI |
| **`text-wrap: balance/pretty`** | Prevents awkward title breaks and orphan words (progressive enhancement) |
| **CSS-generated separators** | Metadata dots stay out of the HTML and screen reader output |
| **Pull quote breakout** | Adds visual rhythm on large screens without breaking mobile layout |
| **Dark mode tokens** | Respects user system preference automatically |

