| **Metadata** | Sans-serif, smaller, muted | Visually distinct from content so it reads as secondary info |
| **Pull quotes** | Large italic, accent rule, centered | Breaks up the text rhythm and draws the eye |
| **Rhythm** | `> * + *` owl selector | Uniform spacing between all body elements |

**Tip:** Add the `pull-quote--aside` class to a pull quote for a magazine-style floated variant on wide screens.

