## Key Design Decisions

| Element | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Line length** | `42rem` max-width | Keeps lines to ~65–75 characters, the optimal range for readability |
| **Line height** | `1.7` for body | Generous spacing reduces eye strain on long-form text |
| **Fluid type** | `clamp()` | Scales smoothly between mobile and desktop without breakpoints |
| **Font pairing** | Serif body + sans metadata | Serif for comfortable reading; sans creates visual contrast for secondary info |
| **`text-wrap: balance`** | Titles & quotes | Prevents awkward single-word last lines (progressive enhancement) |
| **Pull quote** | Left border + ghost quote mark | Clearly distinct from body text without being heavy |

## Variations

**Centered pull quote** (alternative style):
```css
