  text-align: center;
  border-left: none;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  padding: 2em 1em;
}

.pull-quote--centered::before {
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}
```

Use it with `<blockquote class="pull-quote pull-quote--aside">` to float the quote into the margin on large screens, or `pull-quote--centered` for a symmetrical break in the text.

