## Key design decisions

| Element | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Measure** | `68ch` max width | Keeps lines in the 60–75 character range for comfortable reading |
| **Body type** | Serif, ~18px, `line-height: 1.7` | Generous leading improves readability for long-form text |
| **Title** | Fluid `clamp()`, tight `line-height: 1.1`, `text-wrap: balance` | Scales smoothly across devices and avoids awkward single-word last lines |
| **Metadata** | Sans-serif, muted, dot separators via `::before` | Visually separates "about the post" info from the content itself |
| **Pull quotes** | Larger italic, accent rule, decorative quote mark | Clearly distinct from body text and from regular citation `blockquote`s |
| **Pull quote variants** | `--left`, `--right`, `--wide` | Float and break out of the column on wide screens, but stack on mobile |
| **Spacing** | Lobotomized owl (`> * + *`) | Consistent vertical rhythm without margin-collapse headaches |

The layout also includes dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme` and print styles that unfloat pull quotes and show link URLs.

