## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| **`max-width: 68ch`** | Keeps lines at ~65–75 characters, the most comfortable reading length |
| **`clamp()` font sizes** | Fluid typography that scales smoothly from mobile to desktop without breakpoints |
| **`line-height: 1.7`** on body | Generous spacing aids readability for long-form text |
| **Serif body / sans metadata** | Creates clear visual hierarchy between content and supporting info |
| **`::before` dot separators** | Metadata items stay clean in HTML; separators are purely presentational |
| **`text-wrap: balance`** | Prevents awkward single-word last lines in titles and quotes |
| **CSS custom properties** | Easy theming, plus automatic dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme` |
| **Breakout pull quotes** | On wide screens, quotes extend past the column for editorial emphasis |

To remove the drop cap or breakout effect, just delete those respective blocks.

