.pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  margin: calc(var(--space-unit) * 2) 0;
  padding: var(--space-unit) var(--space-unit) var(--space-unit) calc(var(--space-unit) * 1.5);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
  border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
}

.pull-quote p {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.4em;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin: 0;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

/* Decorative opening quote mark */
.pull-quote::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: absolute;
  top: -0.15em;
  left: 0.2em;
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 4.5em;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  opacity: 0.2;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.8em;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.pull-quote cite::before {
  content: "— ";
}

/* Wide screens: float pull quotes into the margin for a magazine feel */
@media (min-width: 1100px) {
  .pull-quote--aside {
    float: right;
    width: 45%;
    margin: 0.5rem -20% var(--space-unit) var(--space-unit);
    padding: var(--space-unit) 0;
    border-left: none;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: none;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .pull-quote--aside::before {
    display: none;
  }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Print
   ========================================================================== */

@media print {
  .post { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  .post-body { font-size: 11pt; }
  .pull-quote { background: none; break-inside: avoid; }
  .post-body a::after { content: " (" attr(href) ")"; font-size: 0.8em; }
}
```

## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Why |
|---|---|
| **`max-width: 68ch`** | Keeps lines around 60–75 characters, the most comfortable range for reading |
| **`line-height: 1.7`** | Generous spacing for long-form body text |
| **`clamp()` font sizes** | Typography scales smoothly between mobile and desktop without breakpoints |
| **Serif body / sans meta** | Creates clear visual hierarchy between content and supporting info |
| **`text-wrap: balance`** | Prevents awkward single-word last lines in titles and quotes |
| **CSS custom properties** | Easy theming and built-in dark mode support |
| **`.pull-quote--aside` modifier** | Optional magazine-style floated quote on wide screens |

To use the floated variant, add the modifier class: `<blockquote class="pull-quote pull-quote--aside">`.

