## Design Notes

| Feature | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Readability** | 68ch line length and 1.7 line height for body text |
| **Fluid type** | `clamp()` scales the title, body, and quotes smoothly across screen sizes |
| **Hierarchy** | Sans-serif title and headings contrast with a serif body |
| **Metadata** | Flexbox with automatic `·` separators, so you don't add them in markup |
| **Pull quotes** | Three variants: default (left border), `--center`, and `--aside` (floats right on wide screens) |
| **Polish** | `text-wrap: balance/pretty` and tabular numbers for dates |
| **Theming** | CSS variables, with dark mode via `prefers-color-scheme` |
| **Print** | Prints link URLs and keeps pull quotes from splitting across pages |

To restyle the layout, change the values in `:root`. The colors and fonts are all defined there.

