.post-meta > * + *::before {
  content: "·";
  margin: 0 0.6em;
  color: var(--color-border);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.post-author {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.post-meta a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.post-meta a:hover {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Body Text
   ========================================================================== */

.post-body {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1rem + 0.3vw, 1.1875rem);
  line-height: 1.7;
  hyphens: auto;
  text-wrap: pretty;        /* Avoids orphaned words */
  font-kerning: normal;
  font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures;
}

.post-body > * {
  margin-top: 0;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-unit);
}

/* Optional drop cap on first paragraph */
.post-body > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  float: left;
  font-size: 3.6em;
  line-height: 0.85;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0.06em 0.1em 0 0;
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

.post-body h2,
.post-body h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  color: var(--color-heading);
  line-height: 1.25;
  margin-top: calc(var(--space-unit) * 2);
  margin-bottom: calc(var(--space-unit) * 0.5);
}

.post-body h2 { font-size: 1.6em; }
.post-body h3 { font-size: 1.3em; }

.post-body a {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  transition: text-decoration-thickness 0.15s;
}

.post-body a:hover {
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

.post-body strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); }

.post-body code {
  font-size: 0.875em;
  padding: 0.15em 0.35em;
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
  border-radius: 3px;
}

.post-body img {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Pull Quotes
   ========================================================================== */

.pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  margin: calc(var(--space-unit) * 2) 0;
  padding: var(--space-unit) var(--space-unit) var(--space-unit) calc(var(--space-unit) * 1.5);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
  border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
}

/* Decorative oversized quotation mark */
.pull-quote::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: absolute;
  top: -0.15em;
  left: 0.15em;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  opacity: 0.18;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.pull-quote p {
  position: relative;       /* Sits above the decorative mark */
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.4em;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.pull-quote cite::before {
  content: "— ";
}

/* On wide screens, let pull quotes break out of the text column */
@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .pull-quote {
    margin-left: -3rem;
    margin-right: -3rem;
  }
}

/* Variant: centered pull quote without box */
.pull-quote--centered {
  text-align: center;
  border-left: none;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  background: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  padding: var(--space-unit) 0;
}

.pull-quote--centered::before {
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Print
   ========================================================================== */

@media print {
  .post { max-width: none; padding: 0; background: none; }
  .post-body { font-size: 11pt; }
  .pull-quote { break-inside: avoid; background: none; }
  .post-body a::after { content: " (" attr(href) ")"; font-size: 0.8em; }
}
```

## Key Design Decisions

| Choice | Why |
|---|---|
| **`68ch` max width** | Keeps lines at ~60–75 characters, the comfortable range for reading |
| **`line-height: 1.7`** | Generous leading for body text; tighter (1.12) for large titles |
| **`clamp()` font sizes** | Fluid scaling between mobile and desktop without breakpoints |
| **`text-wrap: balance`** | Prevents awkward single-word last lines in titles and quotes |
| **Serif body / sans metadata** | Creates clear visual hierarchy between content and supporting info |
| **Pseudo-element separators** | Metadata dots are added in CSS, so the HTML stays clean |
| **Breakout pull quotes** | On wide screens, quotes extend past the column for emphasis |
| **CSS custom properties** | Easy theming, with automatic dark mode support |

To remove the drop cap, just delete the `::first-letter` rule. For the centered quote style, use `class="pull-quote pull-quote--centered"`.

