/* ---------- Variables ---------- */
:root {
  --color-primary: #4f46e5;
  --color-primary-hover: #4338ca;
  --color-text: #1f2937;
  --color-label: #374151;
  --color-border: #d1d5db;
  --color-bg: #f3f4f6;
  --color-white: #ffffff;
  --color-error: #dc2626;
  --radius: 8px;
  --transition: 0.2s ease;
}

/* ---------- Base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background-color: var(--color-bg);
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  color: var(--color-text);
}

/* ---------- Form Container ---------- */
.login-form {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 400px;
  padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
  margin: 1rem;
  background-color: var(--color-white);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow:
    0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05),
    0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}

.login-form__title {
  margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
}

/* ---------- Form Groups ---------- */
.form-group {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

/* ---------- Labels ---------- */
.form-group label {
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-label);
}

/* ---------- Inputs ---------- */
.form-group input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-family: inherit;
  color: var(--color-text);
  background-color: var(--color-white);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  transition: border-color var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
}

.form-group input::placeholder {
  color: #9ca3af;
}

.form-group input:hover {
  border-color: #9ca3af;
}

.form-group input:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
}

/* Show error styling only after user interaction */
.form-group input:user-invalid {
  border-color: var(--color-error);
}

.form-group input:user-invalid:focus {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
}

/* ---------- Submit Button ---------- */
.btn-submit {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: inherit;
  color: var(--color-white);
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color var(--transition), transform 0.1s ease;
}

.btn-submit:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-hover);
}

.btn-submit:active {
  transform: scale(0.98);
}

.btn-submit:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.btn-submit:disabled {
  opacity: 0.6;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .login-form {
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: none;
    border-radius: 0;
  }
}

/* ---------- Reduced Motion ---------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **CSS variables** | Change the theme color in one place via `--color-primary` |
| **Focus states** | Visible focus rings for keyboard accessibility |
| **Validation styling** | `:user-invalid` shows red borders only after the user interacts |
| **Responsive** | Full-width layout on small screens |
| **Reduced motion** | Respects users' motion preferences |
| **Interactive feedback** | Hover, active (press), and disabled button states |

