  color: var(--color-text);
  background-color: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  transition: border-color var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
}

.form-group input::placeholder {
  color: var(--color-placeholder);
}

.form-group input:hover {
  border-color: #9ca3af;
}

.form-group input:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--color-primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.2);
}

/* Show error styling only after user interaction */
.form-group input:user-invalid {
  border-color: var(--color-error);
}

.form-group input:user-invalid:focus {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
}

/* ===== Submit Button ===== */
.btn-submit {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: inherit;
  color: #ffffff;
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  border: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color var(--transition), transform 0.1s ease;
}

.btn-submit:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-hover);
}

.btn-submit:active {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-active);
  transform: scale(0.98);
}

.btn-submit:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.5);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.btn-submit:disabled {
  background-color: #a5b4fc;
  cursor: not-allowed;
  transform: none;
}

/* ===== Responsive ===== */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .login-form {
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
}

/* ===== Reduced Motion ===== */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **CSS Variables** | Change colors and radius in one place |
| **Focus states** | Visible focus ring for keyboard users |
| **Validation styling** | `:user-invalid` shows errors only after interaction, not on page load |
| **Button states** | Hover, active, focus, and disabled styles |
| **Responsive** | Adjusts padding on small screens |
| **Accessibility** | Labels linked to inputs via `for`/`id`, respects reduced-motion preferences |

The form is centered on the page, which works well for a standalone login page. If you're embedding it elsewhere, remove the `display: flex` centering from `body`.

