| **Active state** | Underline indicator shows the current page |
| **Hover effects** | Subtle background on links, lift effect on the CTA |
| **Responsive** | Collapses to a hamburger dropdown below 860px |
| **Animated toggle** | Hamburger icon turns into an "X" |
| **Accessible** | Focus-visible outlines, ARIA attributes, 44px touch targets, Escape key support, reduced-motion support |

## Customization Tips

- **Dark header:** set `--header-bg: #111827`, `--color-text: #f9fafb`, and `--color-text-muted: #9ca3af`.
- **Transparent over a hero image:** use `background-color: transparent` and remove the border and shadow, then add a class via JS on scroll to restore the background.
- **Centered nav:** add `flex: 1; justify-content: center;` to `.nav-list`.

