| **Active state** | Supports both `.active` class and `aria-current="page"` |
| **Hover/focus states** | Clear visual feedback; `focus-visible` for keyboard users |
| **Responsive** | Collapses to an animated hamburger menu under 860px |
| **Accessible** | 44px touch targets, ARIA attributes, reduced-motion support |

