|---|---|
| **Sticky + frosted glass** | Header stays at the top with a blurred translucent background |
| **CSS variables** | Change colors, height, and spacing from one place |
| **Flexbox layout** | Logo on the left, nav and CTA on the right |
| **Hover/active states** | Subtle background on links, lift effect on the CTA |
| **Active page indicator** | Accent color plus a small dot under the current link |
| **Responsive** | Collapses into an animated hamburger menu below 860px |
| **Accessible** | `aria-expanded`, `focus-visible` outlines, Escape-to-close, reduced-motion support |

### Customization Tips
- **Dark theme:** Change `--header-bg` to `#0f172a`, `--text-primary` to `#f9fafb`, and `--text-secondary` to `#cbd5e1`. Also update the `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85)` in `.site-header` and the `#f3f4f6` link hover color to dark equivalents.
- **Centered nav:** Add `flex: 1; justify-content: center;` to `.nav-list` and move the CTA outside the `<nav>`.
- **Pill-shaped CTA:** Set `border-radius: 999px` on `.cta-button`.

