| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Sticky positioning** | Header stays visible while scrolling |
| **CSS variables** | Easy theming: change colors and sizes in one place |
| **Flexbox layout** | Logo left, nav and CTA right, vertically centered |
| **Responsive** | Collapses to a hamburger menu below 860px |
| **Accessible** | `focus-visible` outlines, ARIA attributes, 44px touch targets, reduced-motion support |
| **Polish** | Hover lift on the CTA, active-page indicator, frosted-glass backdrop |
| **Dark mode** | Adapts automatically to the user's system preference |

To customize, start with the `:root` variables. Changing `--accent` restyles the CTA, active link, and focus rings together.

