## Key Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Sticky header** | `position: sticky` with a frosted-glass `backdrop-filter` blur |
| **Design tokens** | CSS custom properties make re-theming simple |
| **Active link** | Dot indicator below the current page link |
| **CTA emphasis** | Primary color, shadow, and a subtle lift on hover |
| **Mobile menu** | CSS-only hamburger using the checkbox technique, animating to an "X" |
| **Accessibility** | `:focus-visible` outlines, ARIA labels, reduced-motion support |

## Customization Tips

- **Change the brand color:** update `--color-primary` and `--color-primary-hover`.
- **Dark header:** set `--header-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9)`, then lighten `--color-text` and `--color-text-muted`.
- **Center the nav links:** add `flex: 1; justify-content: center;` to `.nav-list` on desktop.
- **Change the mobile breakpoint:** edit the `860px` value in the media query.

For production, consider replacing the checkbox toggle with a `<button>` and a few lines of JavaScript. A button announces its state to screen readers via `aria-expanded`, and it can close the menu on Escape or when a link is clicked.

