## JavaScript (for the mobile toggle)

```javascript
const toggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
const nav = document.querySelector('.main-nav');
const header = document.querySelector('.site-header');

// Open/close the mobile menu
toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
  const isOpen = toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
  toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isOpen));
  nav.classList.toggle('open');
});

// Close the menu with the Escape key
document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
  if (e.key === 'Escape' && nav.classList.contains('open')) {
    nav.classList.remove('open');
    toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    toggle.focus();
  }
});

// Add a shadow to the header once the page is scrolled
window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
  header.classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 10);
});
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Sticky positioning** | Header stays at the top while scrolling |
| **CSS variables** | Easy theming: change colors and sizes in one place |
| **Flexbox layout** | Logo on the left, nav and CTA on the right |
| **Active link indicator** | Underline on desktop, tinted background on mobile |
| **CTA hover effect** | Subtle lift with a colored shadow |
| **Responsive** | Collapses to a hamburger menu below 860px |
| **Animated hamburger** | Transforms into an X when opened |
| **Accessible** | `focus-visible` outlines, ARIA attributes, Escape-to-close, reduced-motion support |

## Customization Tips

- **Dark theme:** Set `--header-bg: #111827`, `--text-primary: #f9fafb`, and `--text-secondary: #d1d5db`.
- **Transparent header over a hero image:** Use `background-color: transparent` and switch to solid in the `.scrolled` state.
- **Centered nav:** Give `.nav-list` `margin: 0 auto` and move the CTA outside the `<nav>` element.

