<article class="post">
  <h1 class="post-title">The Quiet Art of Slow Writing</h1>

  <p class="post-meta">
    <span>By <a href="/authors/jane">Jane Doe</a></span>
    <time datetime="2024-05-14">May 14, 2024</time>
    <span>7 min read</span>
  </p>

  <div class="post-body">
    <p>Opening paragraph with a drop cap...</p>

    <blockquote class="pull-quote">
