**Design notes:**
- **Readable measure:** `65ch` keeps lines at a comfortable length.
- **Fluid type:** `clamp()` scales headings and body text smoothly without many breakpoints.
- **Pull quotes:** They get an accent rule and larger italic type. On wide screens they extend beyond the text column, or float to the side with the `.float-right` modifier.
- **Dark mode:** Only the custom properties change, so the rest of the CSS stays untouched.

