  .header-inner {
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .btn-cta {
    margin-left: auto;
    padding: 8px 16px;
  }

  .nav-toggle-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    cursor: pointer;
    order: 3;
  }

  /* Hamburger icon */
  .nav-toggle-label span,
  .nav-toggle-label span::before,
  .nav-toggle-label span::after {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 22px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-text);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: transform var(--transition), background var(--transition);
  }

  .nav-toggle-label span::before,
  .nav-toggle-label span::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  .nav-toggle-label span::before { top: -7px; }
  .nav-toggle-label span::after  { top: 7px; }

  /* Animate to an X when open */
  .nav-toggle:checked + .nav-toggle-label span {
    background: transparent;
  }
  .nav-toggle:checked + .nav-toggle-label span::before {
    transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg);
  }
  .nav-toggle:checked + .nav-toggle-label span::after {
    transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg);
  }

  /* Dropdown nav */
  .main-nav {
    position: absolute;
    top: var(--header-height);
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }

  .nav-toggle:checked ~ .main-nav {
    max-height: 400px;
  }

  .main-nav ul {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 12px 24px 20px;
  }

  .main-nav a {
    padding: 12px 8px;
  }
}
```

## Notes

- **Layout:** Flexbox places the logo on the left. `margin-left: auto` on the nav pushes the nav and button to the right.
- **Sticky:** The header stays at the top while scrolling. Change `position: sticky` to `relative` if you don't want that.
- **Theming:** Colors and sizes live in CSS variables at the top, so rebranding takes a few edits.
- **Mobile menu:** It uses a CSS-only checkbox toggle, so no JavaScript is needed. If you need stronger accessibility (such as `aria-expanded`), swap in a small JS-driven button.
- **Accessibility:** Visible `:focus-visible` outlines are included for keyboard users.

