Here is a clean, responsive CSS layout for a blog post using modern practices like CSS custom properties, fluid typography (`clamp`), and optimal reading widths (`ch` units).

```css
/* ==========================================================================
   Variables & Base Setup
   ========================================================================== */
:root {
  --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --font-serif: Georgia, Cambria, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;

  --color-text: #1f2937;
  --color-heading: #111827;
  --color-muted: #6b7280;
  --color-accent: #2563eb;
  --color-border: #e5e7eb;
  --color-quote-bg: #f9fafb;
}

.blog-post {
  max-width: 68ch; /* Optimal line length for readability */
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Post Title
   ========================================================================== */
.post-title {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Metadata Line
   ========================================================================== */
.post-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
}

/* Adds a subtle bullet separator between metadata items */
.post-meta > span:not(:last-child)::after {
  content: "•";
  margin-left: 1rem;
  color: var(--color-border);
}

.post-meta .author {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-heading);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Body Text
   ========================================================================== */
.post-body {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.125rem; /* 18px */
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.post-body p {
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
}

.post-body h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--color-heading);
  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem 0;
}

.post-body a {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

.post-body a:hover {
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Pull Quotes
   ========================================================================== */
.pull-quote {
  margin: 2.5rem 0;
  padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
  background-color: var(--color-quote-bg);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--color-heading);
}

.pull-quote p {
  margin: 0;
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

/* Break pull quotes slightly outside the text column on larger screens */
@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .pull-quote {
    margin-left: -2rem;
    margin-right: -2rem;
  }
}
```

