  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.post-meta > * + *::before {
  content: "•";
  margin-right: 0.5rem;
  color: var(--divider-color);
}

.meta-author {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-color);
}

.meta-category {
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: var(--accent-color);
}

/* ---------------------------------------
   Body Text
--------------------------------------- */
.post-body {
  max-width: var(--measure);
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-size: 1.125rem;
}

.post-body p {
  margin: 0 0 1.5em;
}

/* First paragraph — optional drop cap / larger lead */
.post-body > p:first-of-type {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.post-body > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  float: left;
  font-size: 3.25em;
  line-height: 0.85;
  padding: 0.08em 0.1em 0 0;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent-color);
}

/* Links */
.post-body a {
  color: var(--accent-color);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

.post-body a:hover {
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

/* Subheadings inside the body */
.post-body h2 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin: 2.5em 0 0.75em;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.post-body h3 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin: 2em 0 0.5em;
}

/* ---------------------------------------
   Pull Quotes
--------------------------------------- */
.pull-quote {
  margin: 2.5em 0;
  padding: 0 0 0 1.5rem;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
  position: relative;
}

.pull-quote p {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.45;
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--text-color);
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}

/* Decorative quotation mark */
.pull-quote::before {
  content: "\201C";
  display: block;
  position: absolute;
  left: 0.75rem;
  top: -1.5rem;
  font-size: 4rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--accent-color);
  opacity: 0.35;
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
}

/* ---------------------------------------
   Responsive Adjustments
--------------------------------------- */
@media (min-width: 50rem) {
  /* Full-bleed pull quote on wider screens */
  .pull-quote {
    margin-left: -2rem;
    margin-right: -2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
    background-color: #f7f9fa;
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .pull-quote p {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 30rem) {
  .post {
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem 3rem;
  }

  .post-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .pull-quote p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
}
```

## Key Design Decisions

- **`clamp()` for the title** — scales fluidly from mobile to desktop without extra breakpoints
- **`68ch` max-width for body text** — keeps line lengths comfortable for reading
- **CSS custom properties** — easy to retheme (accent color, fonts, spacing) in one place
- **Pull quote variations** — inline with a left border on small screens; full-bleed with a background on wider screens for visual rhythm
- **Separator via `::before`** — metadata items get bullet separators without extra markup
- **Optional drop cap** — delete the `:first-of-type::first-letter` rule if you don't want it

