```css
/* ==========================================================================
   Blog post layout — title, metadata, body, pull quotes
   ========================================================================== */

:root {
  /* Type */
  --font-display: "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Palatino, Georgia, serif;
  --font-body:    Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  --font-ui:      ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;

  /* Color */
  --ink:       #1c1a17;
  --ink-muted: #6d6862;
  --ink-faint: #a8a29a;
  --accent:    #a8442a;
  --rule:      #e6e1d8;
  --bg:        #fffdf8;

  /* Metrics */
  --measure: 34rem;   /* body column width (~68 characters) */
  --flow:    1.5rem;  /* base vertical rhythm */
}

/* --- Shell --------------------------------------------------------------- */

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.post {
  max-inline-size: var(--measure);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) 1.25rem;
}

/* --- Title --------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post-title {
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  text-wrap: balance;
  hanging-punctuation: first last;
}

/* --- Metadata line ------------------------------------------------------- */

.post-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: baseline;
  margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-muted);
}

/* middot separators between items */
.post-meta > * + *::before {
  content: "·";
  margin-inline: 0.6em;
  color: var(--ink-faint);
}

.post-meta a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration-color: var(--rule);
  text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
}

.post-meta a:hover {
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* --- Body ---------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post-body {
  display: flow-root;   /* contains the floated pull quote */
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.post-body p {
  margin: 0 0 var(--flow);
  text-wrap: pretty;    /* avoids orphans */
}

.post-body > :last-child {
  margin-block-end: 0;
}

/* opening paragraph */
.post-body .lead {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--ink-muted);
}

.post-body h2 {
  margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  line-height: 1.25;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.post-body a {
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
}

/* --- Pull quote ---------------------------------------------------------- */

.pull-quote {
  /* floated variant — sits in the right margin of the text column */
  float: right;
  inline-size: min(42%, 15rem);
  margin: 0.4em 0 1em 2.5rem;
  padding-block-start: 0.75rem;
  border-block-start: 2px solid var(--accent);

  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.375rem;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.3;
  text-wrap: balance;
  hanging-punctuation: first last;
}

.pull-quote p {
  margin: 0;
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-style: normal;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-muted);
}

/* centered / full-width variant */
.pull-quote--center {
  float: none;
  clear: both;
  inline-size: 100%;
  margin: 2.5rem 0;
  padding-block: 1.25rem;
  border-block: 2px solid var(--accent);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 3.5vw, 1.75rem);
}

/* --- Responsive ---------------------------------------------------------- */

@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  .pull-quote {
    float: none;
    inline-size: auto;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
}
```

### How the pieces work

- **Title** uses `clamp()` for fluid sizing and `text-wrap: balance` to keep line breaks even.
- **Metadata line** is a flex row with automatic middot separators between items, so you don't need to add them in the HTML.
- **Body text** sits in a `--measure` column for comfortable reading, with `text-wrap: pretty` to avoid orphaned words.
- **Pull quotes** float to the right by default, with a top accent border and italic display type. Add the `pull-quote--center` class for a full-width, centered version.

