### Blog Post Layout & Key Modules

This layout is built around a centered reading column, with a few distinct sections that handle the main content pieces.

- **Title & metadata** – The title uses a bold, responsive font size, while the metadata line sits below it with a bottom border and uppercase, muted text. Dot separators are added automatically between metadata items for a clean inline rhythm.
