## Key Features

- **Flexbox layout** — `form-group` uses `flex-direction: column` to stack labels above inputs cleanly.
- **Focus states** — inputs get a soft indigo glow via `box-shadow`, improving accessibility.
- **Invalid state** — uses `:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown)` so errors don't show until the user has typed something.
- **Hover & active feedback** — button darkens on hover and nudges down on click.
- **Accessible focus ring** — `:focus-visible` only shows an outline for keyboard users.
- **Responsive** — `max-width: 400px` with `margin: auto` keeps it centered on any screen.

Feel free to swap the indigo (`#4f46e5`) for your brand color — just update the button background and the input focus border/box-shadow to match.

