  margin-left: auto; /* pushes nav + CTA to the right */
}

.main-nav ul {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.main-nav a {
  display: block;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
}

.main-nav a:hover {
  color: var(--color-text);
  background: var(--color-hover-bg);
}

/* ---------- Call to action ---------- */
.cta-button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1;
  color: #fff;
  background: var(--color-accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
}

.cta-button:hover {
  background: var(--color-accent-hover);
}

.cta-button:active {
  transform: translateY(1px);
}

/* ---------- Focus visibility (keyboard users) ---------- */
.logo:focus-visible,
.main-nav a:focus-visible,
.cta-button:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .header-inner {
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  /* Hide inline links; swap in a hamburger button that toggles a drawer */
  .main-nav {
    display: none;
  }

  .cta-button {
    margin-left: auto;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .main-nav a,
  .cta-button {
    transition: none;
  }
}
```

### Header Layout & Interaction

This header keeps things simple and responsive, with a few thoughtful touches for usability.

- **Sticky, frosted bar:** The header stays pinned to the top with a subtle blur and border, so navigation is always within reach without feeling heavy.
- **Flexbox alignment:** The logo sits on the left, while the nav and CTA are pushed to the right using `margin-left: auto` on the nav. This keeps the layout balanced and easy to scan.
- **Clear hover and focus states:** Links get a soft background on hover, and the CTA button darkens and shifts slightly on press. Keyboard users see a visible outline on focus.
- **Mobile-friendly behavior:** Below 768px, the inline nav links are hidden and the CTA moves to the right, leaving room for a hamburger menu you can add later.
- **Reduced motion support:** Animations are disabled for users who prefer less motion, respecting accessibility settings.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the placeholder logo image (`/logo.svg`) and the `href` values in the nav and CTA links with your own brand assets and URLs.

