## CSS

```css
/* ---------- Base / Reset ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

:root {
  --header-height: 72px;
  --header-bg: #ffffff;
  --header-border: #e5e7eb;
  --text-color: #111827;
  --text-muted: #4b5563;
  --brand-color: #2563eb;
  --brand-color-hover: #1d4ed8;
  --radius: 8px;
  --transition: 0.2s ease;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  color: var(--text-color);
}

/* ---------- Header Shell ---------- */
.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: var(--header-bg);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--header-border);
  backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(8px);
}

.header-container {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 2rem;
  max-width: 1200px;
  height: var(--header-height);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 1.5rem;
}

/* ---------- Logo ---------- */
.logo {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--text-color);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.logo img {
  display: block;
  height: 32px;
  width: auto;
}

.logo-text {
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

/* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
.main-nav {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

.nav-list {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 2rem;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nav-link {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.5rem 0;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  transition: color var(--transition);
}

.nav-link:hover,
.nav-link:focus-visible {
  color: var(--text-color);
}

/* Animated underline */
.nav-link::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--brand-color);
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left;
  transition: transform var(--transition);
}

.nav-link:hover::after,
.nav-link:focus-visible::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}

/* ---------- CTA Button ---------- */
.cta-button {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
  background: var(--brand-color);
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: background-color var(--transition),
              transform var(--transition),
              box-shadow var(--transition);
  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
}

.cta-button:hover,
.cta-button:focus-visible {
  background: var(--brand-color-hover);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
}

.cta-button:active {
  transform: translateY(0);
}

/* ---------- Focus Styles ---------- */
.nav-link:focus-visible,
.cta-button:focus-visible,
.logo:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--brand-color);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .header-container {
    padding: 0 1rem;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .main-nav {
    display: none; /* Replace with a hamburger menu pattern */
  }

  .logo-text {
    display: none;
  }

  .cta-button {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
}

/* ---------- Reduced Motion ---------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```

## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Sticky positioning** | Keeps navigation accessible while scrolling; common pattern for modern sites. |
| **Flexbox layout** | `justify-content: space-between` distributes logo, nav, and CTA evenly; `flex: 1` on nav centers the links. |
| **CSS variables** | Theming is centralized — swap `--brand-color` to rebrand instantly. |
| **Animated underline** | Uses `transform: scaleX()` for GPU-accelerated, non-layout-shifting hover. |
| **`clamp` / `rem` sizing** | Scalable typography that respects user font-size preferences. |
| **`focus-visible`** | Keyboard users get clear focus rings; mouse users don't see them. |
| **`prefers-reduced-motion`** | Accessibility for users sensitive to motion. |
| **`backdrop-filter`** | Subtle frosted-glass effect when content scrolls beneath. |

## Responsive Behavior

At `≤768px`, the nav is hidden. For production, pair this with a hamburger toggle — the pattern below works well:

```css
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .main-nav {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    background: var(--header-bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--header-border);
    padding: 1rem;
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .main-nav.is-open {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .nav-list {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
}
```

Then toggle `.is-open` via JS on a hamburger button click.

