  --color-muted: #5b6472;
  --color-accent: #4f46e5;
  --color-accent-hover: #4338ca;
  --color-border: #e6e8ec;

  --radius-pill: 999px;
  --radius-md: 10px;

  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgb(16 24 40 / 0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 6px 16px rgb(16 24 40 / 0.12);

  --ease: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  --transition: 180ms var(--ease);
}

/* ---------- Header shell ---------- */
.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.82);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(180%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(180%);
}

.site-header__inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);

  max-width: 1200px;
  height: var(--header-height);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);
}

/* ---------- Logo ---------- */
.logo {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;

  font-size: 1.125rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--color-text);
  text-decoration: none;
}

.logo__mark {
  width: 1.75rem;
  height: 1.75rem;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
.nav {
  margin-inline-start: auto; /* pushes nav + CTA to the right */
}

.nav__list {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(0.5rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);

  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.nav__link {
  position: relative;
  display: block;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.25rem;

  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color var(--transition);
}

/* Animated underline */
.nav__link::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline: 0.25rem;
  bottom: 0.25rem;
  height: 2px;
  border-radius: 2px;
  background: currentColor;

  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left center;
  transition: transform var(--transition);
}

.nav__link:hover,
.nav__link:focus-visible {
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.nav__link:hover::after,
.nav__link:focus-visible::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}

/* ---------- Buttons ---------- */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;

  padding: 0.6875rem 1.25rem;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);

  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;

  transition:
    background-color var(--transition),
    box-shadow var(--transition),
    transform var(--transition);
}

.btn--cta {
  background: var(--color-accent);
  color: #fff;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

.btn--cta:hover {
  background: var(--color-accent-hover);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.btn--cta:active {
  transform: translateY(0);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

/* ---------- Mobile menu toggle ---------- */
.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;

  width: 2.5rem;
  height: 2.5rem;
  padding: 0;

  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  color: var(--color-text);
  cursor: pointer;

  transition: background-color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
}

.nav-toggle:hover {
  background: #f4f5f7;
  border-color: #d8dbe1;
}

/* ---------- Focus visibility (keyboard users) ---------- */
.logo:focus-visible,
.nav__link:focus-visible,
.btn:focus-visible,
.nav-toggle:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 860px) {
  :root {
    --header-height: 4rem;
  }

  .nav {
    display: none; /* replace with an off-canvas panel toggled by JS */
  }

  .btn--cta {
    margin-inline-start: auto; /* keeps CTA right-aligned once nav is hidden */
  }

  .nav-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 420px) {
  .btn--cta {
    padding-inline: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
}

/* ---------- Reduced motion ---------- */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```
### Header Layout & Interaction Breakdown

This header is built with a flexible, responsive layout that keeps navigation clear and accessible.

- **Sticky header shell** – stays pinned to the top with a subtle blur and bottom border, so navigation is always available while scrolling.
- **Logo area** – combines a simple SVG mark with the brand name, using a flex layout for consistent alignment.
- **Navigation links** – display in a horizontal row on desktop, with an animated underline that slides in on hover or focus.
- **Call-to-action button** – a pill-shaped primary button that lifts slightly on hover and returns to its original position when pressed.
- **Mobile toggle** – below 860px, the navigation links hide and a hamburger button appears; the CTA remains right-aligned, and the toggle is ready for JavaScript to open a menu.
- **Accessibility touches** – focus outlines are visible for keyboard users, and reduced-motion preferences are respected.
---

**Optimization Tip:** To make the mobile menu functional, you can add JavaScript that toggles an `is-open` class on the header and updates `aria-expanded` when the hamburger button is clicked.

