:root {
  --header-bg:        #ffffff;
  --header-border:    #e6e8eb;
  --text:             #16191d;
  --text-muted:       #5b6470;
  --accent:           #2563eb;
  --accent-hover:     #1d4ed8;
  --accent-contrast:  #ffffff;
  --focus-ring:       #2563eb;

  --radius:           8px;
  --header-height:    72px;
  --container:        1200px;
  --gutter:           clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
  --nav-gap:          clamp(0.75rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
}

/* ============================================================
   Header shell
   ============================================================ */
.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: var(--header-bg);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--header-border);
}

.site-header__inner {
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding-inline: var(--gutter);
  min-height: var(--header-height);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
}

/* ============================================================
   Logo
   ============================================================ */
.logo {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.625rem;
  flex: none;
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.logo__mark {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  flex: none;
}

/* ============================================================
   Primary navigation
   ============================================================ */
.primary-nav {
  margin-inline-start: auto; /* pushes nav + CTA to the right */
}

.primary-nav__list {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--nav-gap);
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.primary-nav__link {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.5rem 0.25rem;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.18s ease;
}

/* Animated underline */
.primary-nav__link::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline: 0.25rem;
  bottom: 0.25rem;
  height: 2px;
  background: currentColor;
  border-radius: 2px;
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left center;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.primary-nav__link:hover,
.primary-nav__link:focus-visible {
  color: var(--text);
}

.primary-nav__link:hover::after,
.primary-nav__link:focus-visible::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}

/* Current page */
.primary-nav__link[aria-current="page"] {
  color: var(--text);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.primary-nav__link[aria-current="page"]::after {
  transform: scaleX(1);
}

/* ============================================================
   Call-to-action button
   ============================================================ */
.header-cta {
  margin-inline-start: auto; /* keeps it pinned right on mobile */
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.625rem 1.125rem;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1;
  white-space: nowrap;
  color: var(--accent-contrast);
  background-color: var(--accent);
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.18s ease,
              transform 0.18s ease,
              box-shadow 0.18s ease;
}

.header-cta:hover {
  background-color: var(--accent-hover);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgb(37 99 235 / 0.28);
}

.header-cta:active {
  transform: translateY(1px);
  box-shadow: none;
}

/* ============================================================
   Mobile menu toggle (hidden on desktop)
   ============================================================ */
.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  padding: 0;
  background: none;
  border: 0;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.menu-toggle__bars,
.menu-toggle__bars::before,
.menu-toggle__bars::after {
  display: block;
  width: 20px;
  height: 2px;
  margin-inline: auto;
  background: var(--text);
  border-radius: 2px;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
}

.menu-toggle__bars::before,
.menu-toggle__bars::after {
  content: "";
  position: relative;
}

.menu-toggle__bars::before { top: -6px; }
.menu-toggle__bars::after  { top: 4px; }

/* ============================================================
   Focus styles
   ============================================================ */
:where(.site-header a, .site-header button):focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--focus-ring);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

/* ============================================================
   Responsive
   ============================================================ */
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .primary-nav {
    display: none; /* swap for a drawer toggled by .menu-toggle */
  }

  .menu-toggle {
    display: block;
  }

  .header-cta {
    padding: 0.5625rem 0.9375rem;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 380px) {
  .header-cta {
    display: none; /* or move it inside the mobile drawer */
  }
}

/* ============================================================
   Accessibility helpers
   ============================================================ */
.visually-hidden {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  margin: -1px;
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip-path: inset(50%);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .site-header *,
  .site-header *::before,
  .site-header *::after {
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}
```
### Design highlights: a header that feels effortless

The header keeps things simple, but each detail is tuned for clarity and comfort.

- **Sticky positioning** keeps the navigation and CTA always within reach, reducing scroll friction.
- **Color hierarchy** uses a muted gray for inactive links and a bold blue for the CTA, so the primary action naturally draws the eye.
- **Subtle hover underline** on nav links adds a polished, responsive feel without being distracting.
- **Flexible spacing** with `clamp()` and a max-width container keeps the layout balanced from mobile to desktop.
- **Responsive shift** below 820px hides the nav and reveals a hamburger menu, preserving screen space on smaller devices.
---

**Optimization Tip:** You can replace the placeholder logo SVG and the Acme brand name with your own assets. The mobile menu button currently has no JavaScript behavior, so you may want to wire it to a drawer or dropdown.

