Key choices: a `42rem` max-width keeps line length in the 60–75 character range, the pull quote uses a left accent bar (plus a centered variant), and the metadata line uses flexbox so it wraps gracefully on narrow screens.

# Blog Post Layout CSS

A complete, production-ready stylesheet with fluid typography, a readable measure, and accessible pull quotes.

```css
/* ============================================
   BLOG POST LAYOUT
   ============================================ */

/* ---------- 1. Design Tokens ---------- */
:root {
  /* Color */
  --color-bg: #ffffff;
  --color-text: #1a1a1a;
  --color-text-muted: #6b7280;
  --color-accent: #2563eb;
  --color-accent-soft: #eff6ff;
  --color-rule: #e5e7eb;
  --color-quote-bar: #d1d5db;

  /* Typography */
  --font-body: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI",
               Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-display: ui-serif, Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;

  --text-base: clamp(1rem, 0.95rem + 0.25vw, 1.125rem);
  --text-title: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 3vw, 3.25rem);
  --text-meta: 0.875rem;
  --text-quote: clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.8vw, 1.75rem);

  /* Spacing */
  --space-xs: 0.5rem;
  --space-sm: 0.75rem;
  --space-md: 1.25rem;
  --space-lg: 2rem;
  --space-xl: 3rem;

  /* Layout */
  --measure: 68ch;          /* ideal line length for body copy */
  --radius: 8px;
}

/* ---------- 2. Dark Mode ---------- */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-bg: #0f1115;
    --color-text: #e8eaed;
    --color-text-muted: #9aa3af;
    --color-accent: #7aa2f7;
    --color-accent-soft: #16203a;
    --color-rule: #262b33;
    --color-quote-bar: #3a4250;
  }
}

/* ---------- 3. Base ---------- */
*,
*::before,
*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--color-bg);
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  line-height: 1.7;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}

/* ---------- 4. Article Shell ---------- */
.post {
  max-width: var(--measure);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md) var(--space-2xl, 5rem);
}

/* ---------- 5. Title ---------- */
.post__title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--text-title);
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  text-wrap: balance;          /* prevents orphaned words */
}

/* Optional eyebrow / category label above the title */
.post__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

/* Optional subtitle / dek */
.post__subtitle {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  font-size: 1.125em;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

/* ---------- 6. Metadata Line ---------- */
.post__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  font-size: var(--text-meta);
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.post__meta a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.post__meta a:hover,
.post__meta a:focus-visible {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
}

/* Dot separator between meta items */
.post__meta > * + *::before {
  content: "·";
  margin-right: var(--space-sm);
  color: var(--color-quote-bar);
}

/* Hide the separator before the first item after an avatar, if used */
.post__meta img + *::before { content: none; }

/* Author avatar */
.post__avatar {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  margin-right: var(--space-xs);
}

/* ---------- 7. Body Copy ---------- */
.post__body > * + * {
  margin-top: var(--space-md);
}

.post__body p {
  margin: 0;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

/* Headings inside the body */
.post__body h2,
.post__body h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
}

.post__body h2 { font-size: 1.5em; }
.post__body h3 { font-size: 1.2em; }

/* Links */
.post__body a {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
}

.post__body a:hover { text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }

/* Lists */
.post__body ul,
.post__body ol { padding-left: 1.4em; }
.post__body li + li { margin-top: 0.35em; }

/* Media */
.post__body img,
.post__body video {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  display: block;
}

.post__body figure { margin: var(--space-lg) 0; }
.post__body figcaption {
  margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  text-align: center;
}

/* Code */
.post__body code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 0.875em;
  background: var(--color-accent-soft);
  padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.post__body pre {
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding: var(--space-md);
  background: var(--color-accent-soft);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.post__body pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }

/* ---------- 8. Pull Quote ---------- */
.pull-quote {
  margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  padding: var(--space-md) 0 var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: var(--text-quote);
  line-height: 1.4;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--color-text);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.pull-quote p { margin: 0; }

/* Attribution line */
.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

/* Variant: centered, no bar, subtle background */
.pull-quote--centered {
  border-left: 0;
  padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
  background: var(--color-accent-soft);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  text-align: center;
}

/* Variant: oversized decorative quote mark */
.pull-quote--marked {
  position: relative;
  border-left: 0;
  padding-left: 0;
  text-align: center;
}

.pull-quote--marked::before {
  content: "\201C";
  display: block;
  font-size: 4rem;
  line-height: 0.6;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  opacity: 0.35;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
}

/* ---------- 9. Footer / Tags ---------- */
.post__footer {
  margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  padding-top: var(--space-md);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.post__tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--space-xs);
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
}

.post__tags a {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.post__tags a:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-accent);
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

/* ---------- 10. Accessibility ---------- */
:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  border-radius: 2px;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}

/* ---------- 11. Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  .post { padding-inline: var(--space-md); }
  .pull-quote {
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
    border-left-width: 3px;
  }
  .post__meta { font-size: 0.8125rem; }
}

/* ---------- 12. Print ---------- */
@media print {
  .post { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  .post__meta, .post__footer { display: none; }
  .pull-quote { border-left: 2px solid #000; }
}
