## Key design decisions

| Element | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Title** | Fluid `clamp()` sizing, serif display face, `text-wrap: balance` to avoid ragged last lines |
| **Metadata** | Flex row with `·` separators injected via `::before` (no extra markup), muted color, hairline rule below |
| **Body** | `68ch` measure for ~70-character lines, `1.7` line-height, `text-wrap: pretty` to prevent orphans |
| **Pull quote** | Accent left bar + larger serif type; three variants (`--centered`, `--marked`) for visual variety |

**Easy tweaks:** change `--measure` to widen/narrow the column, swap `--font-display` for a brand font, or set `--color-accent` to retheme everything at once.

