# Blog Post Layout — CSS

A complete, self-contained stylesheet: design tokens, title, metadata line, body copy, and pull quotes (plus images, lists, and dark mode).

```css
/* ================================================================
   BLOG POST LAYOUT
   ---------------------------------------------------------------
   1. Tokens
   2. Post container
   3. Title
   4. Metadata line
   5. Body text
   6. Pull quotes
   7. Media & extras
   8. Dark mode
   9. Responsive
   ================================================================ */


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   1. TOKENS
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
:root {
  /* Typefaces */
  --font-body: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  --font-display: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
  --font-ui: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;

  /* Scale */
  --text-size: 1.125rem;   /* 18px */
  --text-leading: 1.7;
  --measure: 34rem;        /* ~65 characters per line */

  /* Color */
  --color-bg: #fdfdfc;
  --color-text: #1f2328;
  --color-muted: #6b7280;
  --color-accent: #b45309;
  --color-rule: #e6e6e3;
  --color-quote-bg: #f7f6f3;

  /* Spacing */
  --space-xs: 0.5rem;
  --space-sm: 1rem;
  --space-md: 1.75rem;
  --space-lg: 3rem;
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   2. POST CONTAINER
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.post {
  max-width: var(--measure);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
  background: var(--color-bg);
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-size);
  line-height: var(--text-leading);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   3. TITLE
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.post__title {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.2rem + 3.2vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

/* Optional kicker / eyebrow above the title */
.post__kicker {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

/* Optional subtitle / deck */
.post__subtitle {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-style: italic;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  text-wrap: balance;
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   4. METADATA LINE
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.post__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);

  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

.post__meta a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
}

.post__meta a:hover {
  color: var(--color-text);
  border-bottom-color: currentColor;
}

/* Dot separator between items */
.post__meta > * + *::before {
  content: "·";
  margin-right: 0.5rem;
  color: var(--color-rule);
}

/* Author avatar (optional) */
.post__meta img,
.post__avatar {
  width: 1.75rem;
  height: 1.75rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  margin-right: 0.25rem;
}

/* Tag / category chip */
.post__tag {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   5. BODY TEXT
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.post__body > * + * {
  margin-top: var(--space-md);
}

.post__body p {
  margin: 0;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

/* Headings inside the body */
.post__body h2 {
  margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  margin-bottom: calc(var(--space-md) / 2);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.post__body h3 {
  margin-top: var(--space-md);
  margin-bottom: calc(var(--space-sm) / 2);
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

/* Links */
.post__body a {
  color: var(--color-accent);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
  text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 40%, transparent);
  transition: text-decoration-color 0.15s ease;
}

.post__body a:hover {
  text-decoration-color: currentColor;
}

/* Lists */
.post__body ul,
.post__body ol {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 1.4em;
}

.post__body li + li {
  margin-top: 0.4em;
}

.post__body li::marker {
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

/* Blockquote (regular, not a pull quote) */
.post__body blockquote {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: var(--space-md);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--color-rule);
  color: var(--color-muted);
  font-style: italic;
}

/* Code */
.post__body code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.875em;
  padding: 0.15em 0.35em;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
}

.post__body pre {
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding: var(--space-sm);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #1f2328;
  color: #e6edf3;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.post__body pre code {
  padding: 0;
  background: none;
  color: inherit;
  font-size: inherit;
}

/* Horizontal rule */
.post__body hr {
  height: 1px;
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  border: 0;
  background: var(--color-rule);
}

/* First paragraph: optional drop cap */
.post__body > p:first-of-type::first-letter {
  float: left;
  margin: 0.05em 0.1em 0 0;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 3.2em;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 0.8;
  color: var(--color-accent);
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   6. PULL QUOTES
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-md) var(--space-md) calc(var(--space-md) + 0.75rem);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
  background: var(--color-quote-bg);
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;

  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.375rem;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--color-text);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.pull-quote p {
  margin: 0;
}

/* Decorative quotation mark */
.pull-quote::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: absolute;
  top: -0.35em;
  left: 0.6rem;
  font-size: 3.5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  opacity: 0.25;
}

/* Attribution / source line */
.pull-quote cite,
.pull-quote__source {
  display: block;
  margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

.pull-quote cite::before {
  content: "— ";
}

/* --- Variant: centered, no background --- */
.pull-quote--centered {
  padding: var(--space-md) 0;
  border-left: 0;
  background: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.pull-quote--centered::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: static;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  font-size: 3rem;
  opacity: 0.3;
}

/* --- Variant: large display quote --- */
.pull-quote--display {
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  background: none;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.125rem);
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.pull-quote--display::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: static;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 4rem;
  opacity: 0.25;
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   7. MEDIA & EXTRAS
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
.post__body figure {
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
}

.post__body img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.post__body figcaption {
  margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  text-align: center;
}

/* Footer / article end */
.post__footer {
  margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  padding-top: var(--space-md);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   8. DARK MODE
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-bg: #14171a;
    --color-text: #e6e6e3;
    --color-muted: #9aa0a6;
    --color-accent: #f0a868;
    --color-rule: #2b3035;
    --color-quote-bg: #1c2024;
  }
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------------
   9. RESPONSIVE
   --------------------------------------------------------------- */
@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  :root {
    --text-size: 1.0625rem;
    --space-lg: 2.25rem;
  }

  .post {
    padding-inline: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .pull-quote {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-sm) var(--space-sm) calc(var(--space-sm) + 0.6rem);
  }

  /* Stack metadata on narrow screens */
  .post__meta {
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
}
```

