.pullquote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.9rem;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

/* Pull quote without a source (no <cite>) */
.pullquote p + p {
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--color-muted);
}

/* --- Responsive tweaks ------------------------------ */
@media (max-width: 30rem) {
  .post__meta {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .pullquote {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    border-left-width: 3px;
  }
}

/* --- Print ------------------------------------------ */
@media print {
  body { padding: 0; font-size: 11pt; }
  .pullquote { background: none; border-left: 2pt solid #000; }
}
```

**Key design decisions:**
- **Measure (`--measure: 42rem`)** keeps line length around 65–75 characters for comfortable reading.
- **Two font stacks** — sans-serif for UI elements (title, meta, quote) and serif for body copy.
- **`clamp()`** scales the title and body fluidly without media-query breakpoints.
- **Pull quote** uses a tinted background, accent left border, and an oversized decorative `"` via `::before`.
- **`text-wrap: balance`** on the title and quote prevents awkward line breaks (supported in modern browsers; harmless where unsupported).

# Blog Post Layout — CSS

A self-contained stylesheet with design tokens, fluid type, accessible pull quotes, and dark-mode support.

```css
/* ==========================================================================
   BLOG POST LAYOUT
   1. Design tokens
   2. Page / article shell
   3. Title
   4. Metadata line
   5. Body copy
   6. Pull quotes
   7. Media, code, tables
   8. Responsive & motion
   ========================================================================== */


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1. DESIGN TOKENS
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

:root {
  /* Type */
  --font-body: "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Palatino, Georgia,
               ui-serif, serif;
  --font-ui: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
             "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas,
               "Liberation Mono", monospace;

  /* Color */
  --color-bg: #fdfdfc;
  --color-surface: #f6f5f2;
  --color-text: #1c1e21;
  --color-text-muted: #6a7078;
  --color-accent: #9a4b1e;
  --color-accent-soft: #f3e7de;
  --color-rule: #e3e1dc;
  --color-link: #1a5fb4;
  --color-focus: #1a5fb4;

  /* Measure & rhythm */
  --content-width: 44rem;   /* ~70 characters */
  --prose-width: 68ch;
  --space-xs: 0.5rem;
  --space-sm: 0.75rem;
  --space-md: 1.25rem;
  --space-lg: 2rem;
  --space-xl: 3rem;
  --space-2xl: 4.5rem;

  /* Effects */
  --radius-sm: 4px;
  --radius-md: 10px;
  --shadow-soft: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 4%), 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 4%);
}

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --color-bg: #14161a;
    --color-surface: #1c1f24;
    --color-text: #e6e4e0;
    --color-text-muted: #9aa1ab;
    --color-accent: #e8a87c;
    --color-accent-soft: #2a2118;
    --color-rule: #2c3037;
    --color-link: #8ab4f8;
    --color-focus: #8ab4f8;
    --shadow-soft: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / 40%), 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 30%);
  }
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2. PAGE / ARTICLE SHELL
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

*,
*::before,
*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

html {
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--color-bg);
  color: var(--color-text);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 0.98rem + 0.4vw, 1.1875rem);
  line-height: 1.7;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

.post {
  max-width: var(--content-width);
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-lg) var(--space-2xl);
}

.post__body {
  max-width: var(--prose-width);
}

/* Skip link (accessibility) */
.skip-link {
  position: absolute;
  left: -9999px;
  top: 0;
  background: var(--color-text);
  color: var(--color-bg);
  padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
  z-index: 100;
}
.skip-link:focus {
  left: 0.5rem;
  top: 0.5rem;
}

:where(a, button, [tabindex]):focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
  outline-offset: 3px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3. TITLE
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post__title {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.35rem + 3.1vw, 3.25rem);
  line-height: 1.12;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

/* Optional eyebrow / kicker above the title */
.post__kicker {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-accent);
}

/* Optional standfirst / lede */
.post__lede {
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.05rem + 0.4vw, 1.375rem);
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  font-style: italic;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4. METADATA LINE
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-sm);
  margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
  padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.post__meta a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.post__meta a:hover {
  color: var(--color-text);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 2px;
}

/* Avatar */
.post__avatar {
  width: 2.25rem;
  height: 2.25rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  flex: none;
  background: var(--color-surface);
}

/* Separator dot between items */
.post__meta > * + *::before {
  content: "·";
  margin-right: var(--space-sm);
  color: var(--color-rule);
}

/* Hide the dot before the first item after the avatar block */
.post__avatar + *::before { content: none; }

.post__author {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-text);
}

.post__meta-label {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}

.post__meta time { white-space: nowrap; }


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   5. BODY COPY
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post__body > * + * { margin-top: var(--space-md); }

.post__body p {
  margin: 0;
  text-wrap: pretty;
}

/* Headings */
.post__body h2,
.post__body h3,
.post__body h4 {
  margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-sm);
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  font-weight: 700;
  scroll-margin-top: var(--space-lg);
}

.post__body h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.3rem + 0.9vw, 1.875rem);
}
.post__body h3 { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.15rem + 0.5vw, 1.5rem); }
.post__body h4 { font-size: 1.125rem; }

/* Links */
.post__body a {
  color: var(--color-link);
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-link) 40%, transparent);
  transition: text-decoration-color 150ms ease;
}
.post__body a:hover {
  text-decoration-color: currentColor;
}

/* Lists */
.post__body ul,
.post__body ol {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 1.35em;
}
.post__body li + li { margin-top: 0.4em; }
.post__body li::marker { color: var(--color-text-muted); }

/* Figures & images */
.post__body img {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  display: block;
}

.post__body figure { margin: var(--space-lg) 0; }

.post__body figcaption {
  margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  text-align: center;
}

/* Horizontal rule */
.post__body hr {
  margin: var(--space-xl) auto;
  width: 40%;
  border: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
}

/* Tables */
.post__body table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
}
.post__body th,
.post__body td {
  padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  text-align: left;
}
.post__body thead th {
  border-bottom-width: 2px;
  font-weight: 600;
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   6. PULL QUOTES
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

/* Standard pull quote: `<blockquote class="pull-quote">` */
.pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
  padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg) calc(var(--space-lg) + 0.5rem);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
  border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
  background: var(--color-accent-soft);
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.1rem + 0.7vw, 1.625rem);
  line-height: 1.4;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--color-text);
  text-wrap: balance;
}

.pull-quote p {
  margin: 0;
}
.pull-quote p + p { margin-top: var(--space-sm); }

/* Decorative oversized quote mark */
.pull-quote::before {
  content: "\201C";
  position: absolute;
  top: -0.35em;
  left: 0.1em;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 4.5rem;
  line-height: 1;
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--color-accent);
  opacity: 0.25;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* Attribution / source line */
.pull-quote cite,
.pull-quote__source {
  display: block;
  margin-top: var(--space-md);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
}
.pull-quote cite::before { content: "— "; }

/* Variant: centered, no background, for a dramatic break */
.pull-quote--center {
  border-left: 0;
  background: none;
  padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 1.15rem + 1vw, 1.875rem);
}
.pull-quote--center::before {
  position: static;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 0.1em;
  font-size: 3.5rem;
  opacity: 0.35;
}

/* Variant: full-bleed band */
.pull-quote--band {
  border-left: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg);
  text-align: center;
}

/* Plain blockquote (not a pull quote) */
.post__body blockquote:not(.pull-quote) {
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  padding-left: var(--space-md);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--color-rule);
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  font-style: italic;
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   7. CODE
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

.post__body code {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.875em;
  background: var(--color-surface);
  padding: 0.15em 0.35em;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
}

.post__body pre {
  margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  padding: var(--space-md);
  overflow-x: auto;
  background: var(--color-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  line-height: 1.55;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
}
.post__body pre code {
  background: none;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: inherit;
}


/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
   8. RESPONSIVE, MOTION, PRINT
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  :root {
    --space-2xl: 3rem;
    --space-xl: 2.25rem;
  }

  .post {
    padding-inline: var(--space-md);
  }

  .pull-quote {
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-md) var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
  }
  .pull-quote::before { font-size: 3.25rem; }

  .post__meta {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    gap: 0.4rem var(--space-sm);
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
  }
}

@media print {
  body { background: #fff; color: #000; font-size: 11pt; }
  .post { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  .post__meta { border-bottom-color: #ccc; }
  .pull-quote {
    background: none;
    border-left: 2pt solid #000;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .pull-quote::before { display: none; }
  a { color: #000; text-decoration: underline; }
}
