      <span class="post__read-time">8 min read</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="post__body">
    <p class="post__lede">Software has a speed problem...</p>

    <blockquote class="pull-quote">
      <p>Every millisecond you shave off is a decision someone has to live with.</p>
      <cite>— Grace Hopper</cite>
