**Key design decisions:**
- **Rem-based type scale** with `clamp()` so the title and pull quotes scale fluidly across viewports.
- **Two font stacks**: a serif for body copy (readability at length) and a system sans for UI elements (title, meta, footer).
- **Pull quotes** use top/bottom rules rather than a background block — keeps the page clean and works well in both light and dark themes.
- **Metadata line** uses flexbox with wrapping so it stacks gracefully on narrow screens.
- **CSS custom properties** at the top make theming (e.g., dark mode) a one-line change.

