/* ---------- Base / container ---------- */
:root {
  --font-body: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  --font-ui: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --text-color: #1f2328;
  --muted-color: #656d76;
  --accent-color: #2f6f4f;
  --bg-color: #ffffff;
  --quote-bg: #f6f8fa;
  --border-color: #d8dee4;
  --measure: 68ch;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
  background: var(--bg-color);
  color: var(--text-color);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

/* ---------- Article wrapper ---------- */
.post {
  max-width: var(--measure);
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* ---------- Title ---------- */
.post-title {
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  line-height: 1.15;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  text-wrap: balance;
}

/* ---------- Metadata line ---------- */
.post-meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin: 0 0 2rem;
  padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--muted-color);
}

.post-author {
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-color);
}

.post-separator {
  opacity: 0.5;
}

/* ---------- Body text ---------- */
.post-body p {
  margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
}

.post-body h2,
.post-body h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  margin: 2.5rem 0 0.9rem;
}

.post-body h2 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.post-body h3 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.post-body ul,
.post-body ol {
  margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  padding-left: 1.4rem;
}

.post-body li {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.post-body a {
  color: var(--accent-color);
  text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
}

.post-body a:hover {
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

/* ---------- Pull quotes ---------- */
.pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  margin: 2.5rem 0;
  padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
  background: var(--quote-bg);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  font-style: italic;
}

.pull-quote p {
  margin: 0;
}

.pull-quote cite {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 0.9rem;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-style: normal;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted-color);
}

/* ---------- Footer / tags ---------- */
.post-footer {
  margin-top: 3rem;
  padding-top: 1.5rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.post-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-ui);
}

.tag {
  padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
  background: var(--quote-bg);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--muted-color);
}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  body {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.1rem 3rem;
  }

  .pull-quote {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .post-meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
}

/* ---------- Optional: dark mode ---------- */
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root {
    --text-color: #e6edf3;
    --muted-color: #9198a1;
    --accent-color: #6fd3a0;
    --bg-color: #0d1117;
    --quote-bg: #161b22;
    --border-color: #30363d;
  }
}
```

**Key design choices:**

| Element | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Title** | Fluid `clamp()` sizing, tight tracking, `text-wrap: balance` for even line breaks |
| **Metadata** | Flex row that wraps gracefully on mobile, separated by a rule |
| **Body** | Serif face at ~18px with a `68ch` measure for comfortable line length |
| **Pull quote** | Offset block with accent left border, tinted background, italic serif at larger size |

To swap fonts, just change the `--font-body` and `--font-ui` custom properties. To make pull quotes span wider than the text column, add `margin-inline: -2rem;` to `.pull-quote` (and reduce it on mobile).

