    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .site-nav li a {
    display: block;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .site-nav .btn {
    margin-top: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* When the checkbox is checked, show the menu */
  .nav-toggle:checked ~ .site-nav {
    display: flex;
  }

  /* Animate burger into an X */
  .nav-toggle:checked ~ .nav-burger span:nth-child(1) {
    transform: translateY(7px) rotate(45deg);
  }
  .nav-toggle:checked ~ .nav-burger span:nth-child(2) {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .nav-toggle:checked ~ .nav-burger span:nth-child(3) {
    transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg);
  }
}

/* ---------- Accessibility ---------- */
:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    transition: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
  }
}
```

**Key points**
- Flexbox layout with `justify-content: space-between` keeps the logo left, nav right.
- The mobile menu uses a hidden checkbox + `<label>` so it works with **zero JavaScript**.
- Hover underline on nav links is done with a `::after` pseudo-element and `transform: scaleX()` for smooth animation.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` support is included for accessibility.

